    "**Ask** the landlord for the unit number or the LV number.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Požádejte** pronajímatele o číslo jednotky nebo LV."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Ask** what ownership change is being registered on the unit (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Zeptejte se**, jaká změna vlastníka se na jednotce zapisuje (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Check the owner** in the cadastre with your eID and compare the name with the landlord.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Ověřte si vlastníka** v katastru přes eID a porovnejte jméno s pronajímatelem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Don't pay a deposit** until you have seen the flat in person and signed the contract.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Neplaťte kauci**, dokud byt neuvidíte osobně a nepodepíšete smlouvu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Don't sign** with a company in insolvency without legal advice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Nepodepisujte** smlouvu s firmou v insolvenci bez právní rady."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A change of ownership or lien is being registered on this unit": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U jednotky se zapisuje změna vlastníka nebo zástava"
          }
        }
      }
    },
